    "text": "Regulation imposed under the 20th Statement of the Central Provincial Passenger Transport ServicesAuthority Statute No. 01 of 2000 and the Statements No. 24(2)(1)(xiii) and 24(3) of Passenger Transporting",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
